        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued September 24 at 9:02AM CDT by NWS La Crosse WI</headline>
        <description>If traveling through central Wisconsin this morning, be prepared
for fog that could suddenly reduce visibilities to 1/4 mile or
less.

Expect the fog to dissipate between 10 am and 11 am! Slow down
and allow extra time to reach your destination.
</description>
